                "loc": "2CH.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyoora niigo, ange köbha ni ichibharaasi ichincharu gikugira yaae umuene, gösë ange kuringia abhantö Misiri körri anyoore ichibharaasi ichincharu; kugira ÖMÖNENE naakörömërrëëyë iga, ‘Muriihe mötagaacha kuringa ho guiki.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
